# Note: gradle-wrapper.jar, gradlew, and gradlew.bat are intentionally NOT
# ignored here, unlike Flutter's own default template - they let anyone
# (including CI) run `./gradlew` on a fresh clone without a pre-installed
# Gradle or without re-running `flutter create` to regenerate them.
